iate"><addressbook><name>TOKUNAGA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUDA HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI TOSHITAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKUNAGA MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUDA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, TOSHITAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKUNAGA, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A thermostat device (1) controls the flow rate of circulating fluid by linking the rectilinear motion of a thermoelement (52) to the opening and closing of a valve (21). The device comprises a valve assembly (2) including various elements formed integrally, an energizing member (9), and an element assembly (5), which are all provided in an upper case (7) fixed to a lower case (8). In addition to its simplified mounting structure, such a thermostat device (1) permits the valve to operate in stable manner while preventing overshooting and hunting.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention se rapporte à un dispositif thermostat (1) qui commande la vitesse d'écoulement d'un fluide circulant au moyen du lien qu'il établit entre le mouvement rectiligne d'un thermoélément (52) et l'ouverture et la fermeture d'une soupape (21). Ce dispositif comporte un ensemble soupape (2) dans lequel sont intégrés divers éléments, un élément d'excitation (9) et un ensemble d'éléments (5), qui sont tous disposés dans un boîtier supérieur (7) relié à un boîtier inférieur (8). En plus de sa structure de montage simplifié, ce dispositif thermostat (1) permet de faire fonctionner la soupape de manière stable tout en empêchant les surévaluations et les oscillations.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>